The '''Squid Cave''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Squid Cave''' can be accessed from a tunnel in the {{zone|Murkwater Depths}}. It features several {{MobSprite|Lumisquid}}s that may be hunted.

== Tips ==
*Since a large amount of {{stat|pressure resistance}} and {{stat|respiration}} is needed to reach the '''Squid Cave''', and {{MobSprite|Lumisquid}} is difficult to hunt with low-level [[Fishing Nets]], it is recommended to place down [[Huntrap]]s until the player's {{stat|pressure resistance}} is reasonably high and they have a {{Item|Turbo Fishing Net}}.

